  "narrative": {
    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Powell is riding an exceptional demand wave, with new orders surging on multiple mega-project wins. International growth is accelerating, fueled by offshore work, while domestic activity remains steady. The backlog has expanded sharply, signaling a long runway of future activity tied to energy infrastructure and electrification investment cycles, though the pace of converting these orders into revenue is naturally measured due to project timelines.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership has successfully concentrated on large-scale, high-value opportunities, driving a record backlog and strong book-to-bill. Despite some profitability pressure, the solid cash position supports growth investments. The stock’s significant rally reflects market confidence in the team’s ability to convert this order strength into earnings, though disciplined execution on complex mega-projects will be critical to sustaining momentum without eroding margins.",
