        "snippet": "Powell Industries Announces Second Quarter Fiscal 2026\n\n# Powell Industries Announces Second Quarter Fiscal 2026 Results\n\nMay 04, 2026 16:15 ET | Source: Powell Industries, Inc. Follow Powell Industries, Inc.\n\n---\n\nShare\n\n---\n\nHOUSTON, May 04, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Powell Industries, Inc. (NASDAQ: POWL) (“Powell” or the “Company”), a leading supplier of custom-engineered solutions for the management, control and distribution of electrical energy, today announced results for the second quarter Fiscal 2026 ended March 31, 2026. All comparisons are to the second quarter of Fiscal 2025, unless otherwise noted.Key Highlights:\n\n- Revenues of $297 million increased 6%;\n- Gross profit of $88 million, or 29.6% of revenue, increased 5%;\n- Net income of $45.9 million, or $1.25 per diluted share(1), declined 1%;\n- New orders(2) totaled $490 million, an increase of 97%;\n- Backlog(3) as of March 31, 2026 totaled $1.8 billion, an increase of 33%;\n- Cash and short-term investments as of March 31, 2",
